{"text": " In a serious emergency situation, pilots may make a mayday call requiring immediate assistance. In other serious situations, pilots make PANPAN calls. PAN means possible assistance needed. This is used when there is a state of urgency, but the danger is not life-threatening right now. The pilot may request advice and take necessary steps to fix the problem. What does the PANPAN abbreviation PAN mean? PANPAN.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.7, "text": " In a serious emergency situation, pilots may make a mayday call requiring immediate assistance.", "tokens": [50365, 682, 257, 3156, 7473, 2590, 11, 21506, 815, 652, 257, 815, 810, 818, 24165, 11629, 9683, 13, 50650], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17743512695910885, "compression_ratio": 1.6584362139917694, "no_speech_prob": 4.012927490304463e-11}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 6.26, "end": 9.36, "text": " In other serious situations, pilots make PANPAN calls.", "tokens": [50678, 682, 661, 3156, 6851, 11, 21506, 652, 430, 1770, 47, 1770, 5498, 13, 50833], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17743512695910885, "compression_ratio": 1.6584362139917694, "no_speech_prob": 4.012927490304463e-11}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 9.74, "end": 12.34, "text": " PAN means possible assistance needed.", "tokens": [50852, 430, 1770, 1355, 1944, 9683, 2978, 13, 50982], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17743512695910885, "compression_ratio": 1.6584362139917694, "no_speech_prob": 4.012927490304463e-11}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 12.9, "end": 17.54, "text": " This is used when there is a state of urgency, but the danger is not life-threatening right now.", "tokens": [51010, 639, 307, 1143, 562, 456, 307, 257, 1785, 295, 29734, 11, 457, 264, 4330, 307, 406, 993, 12, 392, 620, 4559, 558, 586, 13, 51242], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17743512695910885, "compression_ratio": 1.6584362139917694, "no_speech_prob": 4.012927490304463e-11}, {"id": 4, "seek": 0, "start": 18.1, "end": 2